# 统一换行符：仓库内使用 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.onnx binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.bin binary
*.safetensors binary

# Windows 批处理：cmd.exe 需要 CRLF，且文件按本地代码页(GBK)保存中文提示，
# 因此按二进制原样存取，不做换行或编码转换
*.bat binary

# 文档
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
